obj_id: agentGenerated_SalesVersusProfitByRegion-7047cac9
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Sales Versus Profit By Region
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: b2d821cc-0f30-44b9-a3e4-8ca51382ded5
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region achieves highest performance with 725K sales and 14.9% profit margin
        • Central region shows efficiency issues with only 7.9% profit margin despite 501K sales
        • East region maintains strong 13.5% margin on 679K sales volume
        • South region has lowest sales at 392K but maintains 11.9% margin

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central region cost structure and pricing to improve 7.9% margin
        • Scale West region successful practices to other regions
        • Focus growth investments in South region to increase sales volume
